message: "If you use or adapt these notebooks, please cite them as below."
title: "Python for Engineers: Case Studies from Calculator to Simulation"
abstract: "A sequence of 23 Jupyter notebooks that teach Python through engineering problems, from Python as a calculator for a water tank to molecular-dynamics simulations and research-based flow models. Written for self-study by first-year engineering students; every line of code is commented."
